    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35919" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνοίκ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the house, keeping at
				home,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὄρνις</span>
