				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				866
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνοίκιον, τό,</span>
			<i>house-rent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				48.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.251
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				1
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				6.10
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				104.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σώματι τελεῖ ἐ. ἡ ψυχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.135e
			</span></i>; <i>rent</i> in general, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποθήκης,
