				32.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				520
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>allowance in lieu of quarters,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).144.27
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνοίκιον, τό,</span>
			<i>dwelling,</i>
